			<div class="content" id="post-content-3965325">
									

<p>I was born in the year 2000, and I'm not all that American to begin with.</p>
<p>But I can say that, I know that events like this- These events need to be taken with caution, and as much as I know little of the pain and grief that anyone that has been involved with something like this, I am sensitive to their grief. That being said, this isn't a spectacular article. But it's also<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-416265-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-416265-1')">1</a></sup> not a badly-done one. This is a great article. Admittedly, I didn't think you could pull something as sensitive as 9/11 off&#8230; I had my doubts.</p>
<p>Yet, I enjoyed this article.</p>
<p>This isn't an SCP that's meant to inspire the reader to be blown away with the sheer amount of awesome with how large of a scale it is.</p>
<p>This isn't an SCP that's poorly-done in a way that leaves the reader with a sense of anger or disappointment at how it was made.</p>
<p>This is a well-thought out, well-meaning, and well-executed article that doesn't really blow anyone away, but just leaves you away with an article that's just poignant and good enough, to muster an upvote.</p>
<p>And for that reason alone, is why this is such a great and superb article.</p>
<p>+1</p>
